<title>ITALY: Parmalat, Citicorp to buy Beatrice Foods.</title>
<headline>Parmalat, Citicorp to buy Beatrice Foods.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian dairy foods group Parmalat Finanziaria said it and U.S. banking group Citicorp were buying Canadian food company Beatrice Foods Inc in a deal worth C$290 million.</p>
<p>Parmalat will take a 75.1 percent stake in Beatrice Foods, with its part of the purchase priced at C$230 million dollars.</p>
<p>Citicorp will take a 24.9 percent stake, Parmalat said in a statement at a news conference here.</p>
</text>
